-- @record {"chapter":"bridges","data":{"failure":"Editor is detected but no native session is connected","recovery":"Use setup then enable the project-local plugin in its actual editor; inspect heartbeat before actions"},"key":"0","section":"pitfalls"}
X Editor is detected but no native session is connected -> Use setup then enable the project-local plugin in its actual editor; inspect heartbeat before actions
-- @record {"chapter":"bridges","data":{"failure":"Action is queued/running","recovery":"Poll the same requestId until terminal; do not call it complete or queue a fresh retry"},"key":"1","section":"pitfalls"}
X Action is queued/running -> Poll the same requestId until terminal; do not call it complete or queue a fresh retry
-- @record {"chapter":"bridges","data":{"failure":"Backend restart, timeout or ambiguous completion","recovery":"Inspect native state first; interrupted actions are failed and never automatically replayed"},"key":"2","section":"pitfalls"}
X Backend restart, timeout or ambiguous completion -> Inspect native state first; interrupted actions are failed and never automatically replayed
-- @record {"chapter":"bridges","data":{"failure":"Changed request payload reuses an ID","recovery":"Inspect previous receipt, then choose a new ID only for a new explicit intent"},"key":"3","section":"pitfalls"}
X Changed request payload reuses an ID -> Inspect previous receipt, then choose a new ID only for a new explicit intent
-- @record {"chapter":"bridges","data":{"failure":"Roblox simulation stop preserves edits","recovery":"Require preserveChanges:true for simulation; player EndTest uses exact Server session, then observe Edit playResult"},"key":"4","section":"pitfalls"}
X Roblox simulation stop preserves edits -> Require preserveChanges:true for simulation; player EndTest uses exact Server session, then observe Edit playResult
